    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19568" root="سرط" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرَيْطَآءُ</span></b> , (Jm, M, K, TA,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرَيْطَى</span></b> , (L,)
<i>A kind of soup,</i> or <i>food that is supped,</i> (Jm, M,
K, TA,) <i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَزِيرَة</span> [q. v.]; (Jm, M, TA;) in
the K, erroneously, <i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيرَة</span>: (TA:) or <i>resembling</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَزِيرَة</span>. (L in explanation of the latter
word.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُرَّيْطَى</span>.

